msgstr "Enne alustamist: analüütika"

msgctxt "ui.consent.body"
msgid "We would like to count visits with Google Analytics, which sets cookies in your browser and sends Google the page you are on. It is not needed to check a robots.txt, so it is your choice, and the check works exactly the same either way."
msgstr "Sooviksime külastusi lugeda Google Analyticsiga, mis paneb teie brauserisse küpsised ja saadab Google’ile lehe, millel olete. Robots.txt-i kontrollimiseks pole seda vaja, nii et valik on teie, ja kontroll töötab mõlemal juhul täpselt samamoodi."

msgctxt "ui.consent.never"
msgid "The address you check is never sent to Google, whichever you choose."
msgstr "Aadressi, mida kontrollite, ei saadeta kunagi Google’ile, ükskõik mida valite."

